  "description": "Operator-valued Φ_q brane-tower probe in Wedderburn-block form. For each isotope in {D, T, ³He} and each k in {1,2,3,4,5,6,8,10}, computes tower_op^(k) = Σ_λ y_λ Φ_q^{[≤k]}(|χ^λ_q(β)|/dim V_λ), Wedderburn-summed across irreps of H_{3A}(q_0) via the trusted q-Hecke seminormal infrastructure (per-irrep χ^λ via Hoefsmit, y_λ via Wenzl Schur principal specialization). Promotes the scalar Φ_q-per-generator-volume probe to a convolution-aware higher-irrep form that captures the full Hecke R-matrix structure of the braid operator. Tests whether the scalar-substrate refutation in §'Closure (2026-05-11)' extends to the operator-valued n_⋆ existence claim.",
